Package: rhylthyme
Title: Read and Plot 'Rhylthyme' Schedules with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeremy", "Leipzig", email = "leipzig@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads 'Rhylthyme' programs (JSON descriptions of parallel
    tracks of timed steps: recipes, lab protocols, run-of-shows) and plots
    them as Gantt charts with 'ggplot2'. Step times come from the same
    timing engine that <https://www.rhylthyme.com> uses, embedded through
    'V8', so a plot agrees with the website to the second.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/rhylthyme/rhylthyme-r, https://www.rhylthyme.com
BugReports: https://github.com/rhylthyme/rhylthyme-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    curl,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    jsonlite,
    jsonvalidate,
    utils,
    V8
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    rlang,
    vdiffr,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
